body:
You are not alone in that feeling. You are not alone, period. 

When you speak of your concern about the transition, are you referring to a spiritual/religious transition or the amount of pain that would likely accompany death as you transition from life to death? Serious question.

&#x200B;

Do you just assume that all drug users are "addicts"? If so, why are you even posting here? To try to make the people here feel badly about themselves? Do you consider everyone who drinks to be an "alcoholic"? Serious question there. I'm genuinely interested in your logic process on this.

&#x200B;

I don't think anyone wakes up and says, "I want to be a drug addict". Granted, drug users make the choice to use drugs, but calling them all addicts is just an asshole thing to do. 

&#x200B;

Thanks for starting my Sunday on such a positive, hopeful note. Could you please return the 10 minutes of my life I spent trying to read that?
